  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、本当だ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "本当の……本当に……？\r\n嘘じゃなくて……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nこの目でちゃんと確かめてきたから、間違いないよ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "合格……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……甜花……自分で前に進めたんだ……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2_s",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうしたんだ？",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっと……\r\n不思議な気持ち……してる……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うれしい、とかじゃなくてか？",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……\r\nえっとね……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なんだか……自分じゃない……\r\n誰かの話、聞いてるみたいで……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも……それはなーちゃんたちの、おかげで……\r\n甜花の、ほんとの実力以上の……評価だって思う……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはないぞ\r\n甜花も力をつけてきてるんだから",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "前よりは……できること、増えたよね……\r\nでも……できないことも……多いから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だから……ちょっとずつ……\r\nそういう評価にも、追いついて……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "いつかは……\r\n追い越していけると……いいな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（甜花も、ここまで前向きな言葉を\r\n言うようになったんだな……）",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、そうだな\r\n甜花なら、絶対できるよ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001050130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "できる、かな……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500105/7015001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nだって、甜花はここまで来れたんだからな",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
